cture, two aged RUUD package units), Unit A C4 (2022 LVP and hardwood finish since replaced with vinyl tile - unexplained), Unit B C4 by default (dated, cluttered); gas wall furnace in the 2022 frames not visible in 2026; two gas + two electric meters; BEDROOM COUNT UNRESOLVED (1BR listing vs two bedrooms in frames). Near-term $15-33K vs a $17.5K allowance. Metrics unchanged (CoC 0.5%, DSCR 1.03). NEAR-MISS stands, P ~0.03. | 9/20: rent STATED in remarks '1 bedroom and 1 bathroom. Rented at $750, and $835 each' = $1,585 month-to-month (board 2BR proxy $1,859 and 2BR+2BR mix wrong); verified 2026 bill $1,506.82 (board $593 = ad valorem only). CoC 0.5 / -0.8 / -2.0%, DSCR 1.03 / 0.97 / 0.91; 8% price $126K. Same seller as Edgar and collateral under the same $500K New Republic Bank deed of trust (11802/0067). NEAR-MISS, P ~0.03. | 9/15: NEAR-MISS - county apartment class, income value $62,500 (36% of ask), in-place ask $789 (5/2024), MTM leases; same seller as Rhew/Edgar.",https://www.redfin.com/NC/Fayetteville/2102-Rogers-Dr-28303/home/125506151
