inventory exists (city Survey123 'Water Service Line Material Survey' and 'Lead Service Line Field Survey' results layers hold 13, 133, 2 and 81 records, none within 300 m of Daughtry); ask RMPU for the classification per address",RMPU / Utility Services 252-972-1250 (Call Center); AGOL survey123 results layers (partial),"LDC on Municode Supp. 89 codified through O-2024-41 (6/24/2024); adopted text amendments since, per the city LDC page (read 9/25): O-2024-58 (8/26/2024 sign amortization), O-2024-82 (12/9/2024 fences and walls), O-2025-5 (1/13/2025 plat certificates), O-2025-6 (1/13/2025 clarifying edits: deletes the 'Dwelling, single-family' rows, B-4/B-5 intent, notice tables, board of adjustment reversals at four-fifths, Sec. 1205), O-2025-64 (9/8/2025 pocket neighborhoods in R-8, R-6, R-6MFA, PDR, O-I; 15,000 sf; 4-12 dwellings), O-2026-xx (4/13/2026 internet cafes); outdoor lighting pending; none touches Chapter 11 or the R-10 two-family cell","Sec. 503 Table 5-1: 'Dwelling, two- to four-family' x only in R-6 MFA and PDR (and O-I, O-I(2), B-1 in Table 5-2); blank in A-1, R-15, R-10, R-8, R-6, MHP; no special-use route; 'Accessory dwelling' x in EVERY residential district incl. R-10 under Sec. 507.C (one extra self-contained unit, same lot and ownership, at most 50% of the principal's gross floor area, no owner-occupancy clause); Sec. 601: R-10 10,000 sf / 10,000 per DU / 75 ft width; R-6MFA two-family 7,000 sf / 3,500 per DU / 60 ft; 50 x 150 platted lots are nonconforming lots of record (602/1102) - Daughtry (id 2) NONCONF use + NONCONF lot","Ch. 11 (read verbatim 9/25): 1105.A.3 land uses cease > 180 days -> conform, 'nonconforming uses that have existed for over fifty (50) years are exempt'; 1105.B.4 a nonconforming use of a structure 'discontinued or abandoned for a period of one hundred eighty (180) consecutive days' may not resume; 1107.A 180 consecutive days 'or for more than eighteen (18) months in any three (3) year period'; 1103.B and 1107.B: damage 