 "tax_assessed_combined_rate": {
  "_note": "Adopted 2026-09-15 (file 32): where an assessed value is known, tax = assessed x this combined rate (county + city), not price x stress rate. NC does not reassess on sale; VA cities reassess annually or biennially and converge toward the sale.",
