 "reidsville_housing_authority": "The New Reidsville Housing Authority (924 Third Ave, Reidsville 27320; HCV 336-589-6511) administers the HCV for Reidsville and Rockingham County; payment standards (site, 9/25/2026): 0BR 782 / 1BR 872 / 2BR 1,144 / 3BR 1,247 / 4BR 1,390 = 110 percent of the FY2026 FMRs (Rockingham County NC HUD Metro FMR Area); FY2027 FMRs 705 / 774 / 1,012 / 1,236 / 1,554 -> a rebase would give about 1,113 for a 2BR; waiting list CLOSED; 'not accepting any ports at this time'; utility allowance schedule unpublished; Rockingham County HMFA is not on HUD's mandatory SAFMR list (the list names the Greensboro-High Point HMFA)",
