 },
 "reidsville_housing_authority": "The New Reidsville Housing Authority (924 Third Ave, Reidsville 27320; HCV 336-589-6511) administers the HCV for Reidsville and Rockingham County; payment standards (site, 9/25/2026): 0BR 782 / 1BR 872 / 2BR 1,144 / 3BR 1,247 / 4BR 1,390 = 110 percent of the FY2026 FMRs (Rockingham County NC HUD Metro FMR Area); FY2027 FMRs 705 / 774 / 1,012 / 1,236 / 1,554 -> a rebase would give about 1,113 for a 2BR; waiting list CLOSED; 'not accepting any ports at this time'; utility allowance schedule unpublished; Rockingham County HMFA is not on HUD's mandatory SAFMR list (the list names the Greensboro-High Point HMFA)",
 "rockingham_revaluation": "last 1/1/2024 (rate 0.695 -> 0.5801); NEXT 1/1/2028, advanced from 2029 by the Board of Commissioners' resolution of 10/6/2025 (4-1) on the tax administrator's 8/18/2025 recommendation (equalization risk under the sales-ratio statute; desktop reappraisal contract about 1.14 million; notices by 2/1/2028); the FY2027 budget message: four-year cycle 'effective for the Fiscal Year 2028/29', county 'around 90.8 percent' of market (98 at the 2024 reappraisal); NCDOR's August 2025 table still prints 2029; FY2026-27 county rate 0.569 (cut from 0.5801, adopted 6/1/2026; recommended 0.579)",
 "seller_group_screens": {
  "andrews_properties_llcs": "Andrews Properties of NC LLC / of the Triad LLC / of the Carolinas LLC / and Rentals LLC (Elon NC): 45 Rockingham parcels (NC OneMap 9/25/2026), five Reidsville listings at once in 9/2026 (413-415 Gilmer, 510 Piedmont, 102 S Main, 403 Thomas, 337 S Branch); plaintiffs in M.D.N.C. 1:25-cv-00236 v. City of Burlington (boarding houses; 504 Webb condemned 7/6/2022; opinion 3/31/2026 dismissed Counts 1-8 with prejudice except facial and post-3/25/2022 class-of-one claims; ongoing); 182 Register of Deeds documents under the four names; NC SOS status unread"
 },
 "advisory_56_rules_adopted": {
  "_note": "Adopted 9/26/26 (round 18, 307 N Church St Clayton, new board row w6). Advisory 56's ten unknown unknowns and six pipeline suggestions (photo watermark dating, zoning-history check, stream/buffer/slope intersects, property-based lien search with OCR, assessment-based NC tax, FSBO flag) are accepted; the entries below are what the verification added or amended.",
  "rod_name_index_for_individuals": "run the Register of Deeds both-names index for an individual seller as well as the legal-remarks search: it is a title check, not profiling, and it surfaces instruments the legal index misses - the Church owner's five instruments include two 2026 EASEMENTS to the Town of Clayton (a drainage project on the lot) that no listing, card or layer showed; record counts, types and book/pages, never a dossier",
  "easement_to_municipality_rule": "a recent easement to a town or county is a project signal: read the image for the purpose (drainage / sewer / greenway), the area, the exclusive-use terms (no structures, tree cutting, written approval for grade work), the surveyor's job title (WithersRavenel 'N Church St and E Front St Drainage') and the temporary construction easement's termination; then ask the town's engineer what is being built and when",
  "plat_boilerplate_flood_note": "a surveyor's exhibit note that 'portions of the property are in Zone AE' must be checked against the NFHL polygon before it enters a row: the Church plat carried the note and the whole parcel is Zone X (nearest SFHA about 400 m)",
  "nfhl_polygon_query": "query FEMA NFHL layer 28 (and floodway layer 20) with the PARCEL POLYGON, not a point; report the zone(s), the grid share inside each and the distance from the footprint to the nearest SFHA edge",
  "creek_boundary_geometry": "when a deed runs 'with the meanders of' a branch, pull the town or county parcel polygon by PIN (the OneMap layer failed for Johnston), identify the footprint inside it, and measure footprint-to-stream (Church: 28 ft, inside the 50-ft Neuse buffer) and footprint-to-line distances; the county's 'stream 4 m from the centroid' read becomes a buffer finding",
  "mls_syndication_history": "when Zillow shows a for-sale-by-owner page with no history, the prior MLS listing survives on raleighrealty.com (list date, price, remarks, agent, photo count) and on Redfin's third address page (/home/<id>: 'Listed' and 'Listing Removed' dates); realtor.com and Redfin 'Off Market' confirm the MLS listing is not live; Church: 5/18/2026 at 340,000, removed 6/2/2026",
  "seller_rental_listing_check": "search Zillow rentals for the subject's units during a sale: a seller marketing the vacant unit (Church: unit A at 1,200 on 9/21/2026, 12-month term) fixes the documented roll, signals a holder rather than a cutter, and stops any abandonment clock",
  "own_ask_as_vacant_unit_rent": "under gate6_basis_rule the vacant unit's figure is the block-comp median; when the seller's own current rental ask for that unit exists, carry it as the documented figure and the block-comp median as a second line (Church: 1,200 own ask vs 1,350 block median)",
  "county_sales_export_ratios": "Johnston's TaxJO Sales.aspx + ExportSalesReport.aspx returns every sale in a neighbourhood or township with the CURRENT sales ratio and appraised values: use the qualified median as the reappraisal-stress ratio (00380: 0.916) and filter Use/Mod 62 for the county-confirmed duplex cohort; the on-page grid caps at 50 rows, the export does not",
  "udo_edition_diff": "keep the original, the first amended and the current UDO editions and diff the use table AND the district purpose statements: Clayton's 4/15/2024 edition removed duplexes from the RHD statement but not from RMD's, which is how a stale 'permits duplex dwellings' sentence survives next to a prohibiting table",
  "casualty_clause_vs_fannie": "a UDO clause that bars restoring a nonconforming use after a casualty threshold (Clayton 5.6.7: 51 percent of assessed value, single-family exempted) makes the Fannie B4-1.3-04 rebuild-right letter impossible for a nonconforming duplex: treat conventional financing as unavailable and price the 8.00 leg (DSCR / portfolio) before any offer",
  "determination_fee": "a formal zoning determination has a price (Clayton 500, resubmittal 250) and a Type I procedure with appeal rights; advisory opinions are non-binding - budget the letter and ask for the formal one",
  "utility_stack_per_unit": "price the tenant's monthly utility stack from the town's fee schedule (base charges plus commodity at 700 kWh / 4,000 gal) and carry it as a rent-discount case where a municipal electric utility and wholesale water/sewer pass-throughs apply (Clayton about 305 a unit); the ZIP averages are set by newer, lower-load stock",
  "street_view_thumbnail_param": "streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail needs cb_client=maps_sv.tactile (403 without it); aim at the footprint centroid, not the geocoded street point",
  "transport_0926c": "county tax-bill table: TaxBillSearch/GetSearchTablePartial + GetSearchTableData answer 200 with zero rows for every model tried (parcel with and without dashes, account, owner name, address; SortBy 'TaxYear-Desc' throws 'could not resolve property') - bill and delinquency status UNREAD (Redfin's county-fed tax history stands in: 2026 1,961, 2025 1,981, 2024 2,014); NC OneMap parcels for Johnston: where-clause queries answer 400 and point queries return nothing (the county's rows are present, count 125,583, but unqueryable this way); Census API now requires a key; HAPP payment standards not pub"
 },
 "johnston_clayton_instruments": {
  "_note": "Read 9/25-26/26 (round 18). All plain curl / urllib unless noted; private names appear only inside the public-record images.",
  "tax_portal": "https://www.bttaxpayerportal.com/ITSPublicJO/ : POST BasicSearch/ViewParcel JSON {parcelNumber:'05033035', taxYear:2026} (Content-Type application/json, X-Requested-With) -> HTML parcel view (tax codes, deed, values, township/fire/city, PIN, legal); AppraisalCard.aspx?id=<parcel>/<year> -> PDF card (sketch, components, sales, permits, prior values); POST Base/StaticTableData/ {Page:1, NumRows:null, SortBy:null, SortOrder:null, Table:'SalesData', PostData:'{\"id\":\"<uniq id from the view>\"}'} -> sales JSON; TaxBillSearch/GetSearchTablePartial + GetSearchTableData answer zero rows for every model (bills UNREAD; use Redfin's county-fed tax history)",
  "sales_search": "https://www.bttaxpayerportal.com/TaxJO/Sales.aspx : ASP.NET postback with __VIEWSTATE; fields ctl00$contentplaceholderSalesSearch$usercontrolSalesSearch$ {listboxNeighborhoods (00380 = Town of Clayton Subdivision; 00354 Town of Clayton; 00288 Subdivisions in Downtown Clayton), listboxTownship (5916 = 05 CLAYTON), dropdownlistDateRangeFrom/To Month/Year, radiobuttonlistQualified (1 Q / 0 U / 2 all), radiobuttonlistVacantImproved (0/1/2), textboxHeatedAreaRange1/2, textboxActualYearBuiltRange1/2, buttonSearch}; then GET ExportSalesReport.aspx in the same cookie session -> CSV ('application/excel') with Use/Mod (62 = duplex/tri/quad), book, page, sale date, heated area, Q, land, sales ratio, current sales ratio, appraised, current appraised, price",
  "rod": "https://erec.johnstonnc.com/recorder/ (Tyler EagleWeb): GET web/ then POST web/loginPOST.jsp guest=true&submit=I+Acknowledge (JSESSIONID + isLoggedInAsPublic cookies) -> eagleweb/customSearch.jsp?pageId=DeedRecords; POST eagleweb/docSearchPOST.jsp with SEARCH_ORIGIN=customSearch.jsp?pageId=DeedRecords, AllDocumentsCB=on, docTypeTotal=<count>, every __search_select code, and one of LegalRemarksIDSearchString (Starts With), BookTypeID=DEED + BookPageIDBook/Page, BothNamesIDHuman=h + BothNamesIDSurname + BothNamesIDName; results at docSearchResults.jsp?searchId=N (rows carry viewDoc.jsp?node=DOC<id>, grantor, grantee, Related cross-references, legal); images at eagleweb/downloads/<instrument>.pdf?id=<node>.A0&parent=<node>; ParcelIDSearchString returns nothing",
  "town_gis": "https://cw2.townofclaytonnc.org/gis/rest/services/ : Planning/Zoning/MapServer/0 (Abreviation RMD etc.), Planning/Zoning_Overlays (0 WPOD, 1 FPOD, 2 Historic District = the NR boundary, 3 Gateway), Planning/Future_Land_Use/1, Cityworks/CW_Base (0 addresses APT A/B, 1 parcels by PIN='166913-13-3107' with the county fields incl. NBRHOOD, USE_CODE, HEAT_AREA), Clariti/Clariti_Map (0 county addresses/E911, 3 county parcels - empty at the point, 5 FIRM panel, 6 flood zones, 8 potential stream buffers, 9 potential steep slopes, 13 historic, 14 zoning), Environmental/Clayton_Streams/0 (USGS_Type, Data_Src), Cityworks/CW_WS (11 water meters with account numbers, 12 service lines, 13 water mains, 19 sewer manholes, 27 sewer gravity mains with UP/DOWN_MHID and HIGH_PRIORITY), Cityworks/CW_Electric/19 meters, Public/wService_Line_Status_Public/0, Public/Stormwater_Public",
  "footprints": "https://services1.arcgis.com/YBWrN5qiESVpqi92/arcgis/rest/services/North_Carolina_Composite_Building_Footprints/FeatureServer/0 (60 m point query, then point-in-parcel to pick the subject)",
  "fema": "https://hazards.fema.gov/arcgis/rest/services/public/NFHL/MapServer/28/query POST geometry=<parcel rings> geometryType=esriGeometryPolygon (layer 20 = floodway)",
  "onemap_parcels": "services.nconemap.gov NC1Map_Parcels/MapServer/1: cntyname='Johnston' counts 125,583 rows but where-clause field queries answer 400 and point/distance queries return nothing for this parcel - use the Town's CW_Base parcels layer instead",
  "town_documents": "DocumentCenter/View/7134 UDO current (6/15/2026, 796 pages); 6431 original (11/20/2023); 6789 as amended 4/15/2024; 6788 9/16/2024; 6787 12/16/2024; 3953 7/21/2025; 8405 11/17/2025; 6433 ordinance 2024-04-04 (image only); 231 FY27 comprehensive fee schedule (text layer); 7950 UDO Procedures Manual; UDO page /746/Unified-Development-Ordinance lists editions and ordinances (no separate redlines); fees page /987/Comprehensive-List-of-Fees; budget /850/FY-2027-Town-of-Clayton-Budget; permits /1130/Permit-Clayton-Hub (Clariti, live 7/6/2026); eSuite es.townofclaytonnc.org/eSuite.Permits (trade permits ended 7/1/2026)",
  "county_pages": "johnstonnc.gov/content.cfm?id=2071 (FY2026-27 budget release, rate cut to 51 cents); johnstonnc.gov/tax2/Revaluation.cfm; HAPP johnstonnc.gov/happ/ (waiting list closed; landlord page has forms only; 919-989-5070)",
  "state": "NCDOR /2026-2027countytaxratesfinalxlsx/open (county rate, latest and next reappraisal; parse with zipfile + sharedStrings); ncleg BillLookUp/2025/S497 (history table in the HTML); ncleg G.S. 160D-108 HTML; webservices.ncleg.gov/ViewDocSiteFile/24738 (S.L. 2008-146 reappraisal-trigger presentation with the 75,000+ county list)",
  "hpo": "https://gis2.ncdcr.gov/dncrgis/rest/services/NCHPO_Public/ (certificate chain fails Python verification; use an unverified context): NCHPO_Historic_Resources_boundary_shading/MapServer/0 NR districts (SITE_NAME, SITE_ID, YearListed, LinkPath to the nomination PDF), /3 local districts; NCHPO_Historic_Resources_CNC/MapServer/0 surveyed points (Status SO/SD, HDstatus NRHD, Location); NCHPO_CLGs_and_Commissions",
  "environment": "DEQ ArcGIS Online kCu40SDxsCGcuUWO layers (UST incidents, RUST, AST, NonUST, Pollution_Incidents_2019, DryCleaning_*, Inactive_Hazardous_Sites, landfills, brownfields) by 500 m point query; ECHO cwa_rest_services.get_facility_info p_fn=TOWN OF CLAYTON -> NC0025453 SAM'S BRANCH WRF; dfr_rest_services.get_dfr p_id=NC0025453 (Results.EnforcementComplianceSummaries.Summaries)",
  "listings": "Zillow FSBO page (facts, counters, remarks; no history) and Zillow rental page (Price history 'Listed for rent', facts, parcel number) via Bright Data 1d64e66b; Redfin three pages per address (unit-B, unit-A-B, /home/<id>) via 57ad3277 - the /home/<id> page carried the 2026 MLS listing history; raleighrealty.com/home/<slug> carries the Doorify listing's remarks, agent and photo count; realtor.com M-id page (off-market facts); hotpads empty",
  "street_view": "SingleImageSearch -> photometa/v1 (dated list j[1][0][5][0][8] over j[1][0][5][0][3][0]; pano location j[1][0][5][0][1][0][2:4]) -> streetviewpixels thumbnail with cb_client=maps_sv.tactile&w=1200&h=800&pitch=5&thumbfov=70 at the bearing to the footprint centroid"
 },
