nth'; roof 2016 vs '12 years ago'Úcondition_0924ta•␀␀Unverified. County card 9/24: R2-DUPLEX-RES, 1981, effective 1981, 1,896 sf, one story, slab, exterior 05-DELUX-WOOD-SIDING, heating code M-07&S-01 with central air (AC-Y), roof 03-COMP SHINGLE gable, floor 11-CARPET-COMB, grade 350 100%, condition A 30%, additions 4 (two 32 sf utility rooms and two 24 sf open porches), two 10x12 concrete patios (1983), no permit on record, 'Remodeled 0'; RCN $161,471. The seller's three texts put the roof at 2016 (twice) and '12 years ago' (once) and the HVAC at 'new' in 2017 / '10 years ago'; nothing on file dates either. 2023 aerial: pines over the roof removed since 2021, roof dark and uniform, no tarps (reproduced)Úaerial_0924taë␀␀County CC2001, CC2008, CC2013, CC2017, CC2021 and CC2023 exports served 9/24 (the ImageServer years that answered 'Token Required' on 9/24 morning served at 4326 bbox this evening). 2017: dense pine canopy over most of the roof; 2023: pines gone, crisp uniform dark roof with one mid-slope penetration, two vehicles on the west pad off Landau Rd, one car on the northeast; collector on the north with a double yellow line and a bike/turn arrow. Roof age not datable from imagery (reproduced)Ú
