arack) bills $168, a 928 sf duplex (2614 Pecan) $84; read the line from each billÚrid_lookup_instrumenta␀␀; 9/24 evening: BILL PAYER COLUMN - read the 'Paid By' of every prior bill, not only the status: 'DAVID B CRAIG, ATTORNEY' = the county's tax-foreclosure attorney (davidbcraig.com: 'represents the County of Cumberland in the tax foreclosure matters'; payoffs by certified funds only) so the year was redeemed out of a foreclosure file; a servicer/CoreLogic payment after the interest date = escrow advance; 'YYYY - 700/850' = escrow batch on time. COUNTY OWNER LIKE query for an individual seller lists their other parcels; their bills show whether the default is portfolio-wide. The 2024 and 2025 advertisements live at cumberlandcountync.gov/docs/default-source/tax-documents/delinquent-taxes/delinquent_taxes__YYYY.pdf (underscore pattern; the 2023 file uses the hyphen pattern with ?sfvrsn=782cbf11_2). ROD: the Full System name search reaches deeds of trust and their note amounts; the row's 'Image - N page(s)' button then 'Open in new tab' yields PDFs/User_0_<timestamp>.pdf, which curl fetches (image-only; PyMuPDF) - fetching it ends the browser session. PWC 120Water per-address asset counts (741 and 745 Tamarack one each = per-unit meters). Trulia unit records ('741 Tamarack Dr #A') and a property's second Zillow zpid carry the owner's earlier rent asks and listing textsÚboard_rows_affectedzª; 9/24 evening: r4d Tamarack rebased (advisory 45); stormwater tier rule applies to every Fayetteville row's fee line; the bill-payer rule applies to every Cumberland rowÚverified_onÚsource_linksa0␀␀; https://www.fayettevillenc.gov/City-Departments/Public-Services/Stormwater/Stormwater-Utility-Fee-Structure-Updates; http://www.davidbcraig.com/; https://www.cumberlandcountync.gov/docs/default-source/tax-documents/delinquent-taxes/delinquent_taxes__2024.pdf; https://www.cumberlandcountync.gov/docs/default-source/tax-documents/delinquent-taxes/delinquent_taxes__2025.pdf; https