facts_linezÝ4 bd / 2 ba / 1.5 stories / 1,478 finished sf / 0.29 ac / built 1948 / year renovated 2004 / RS9 / electric forced-air heat, central AC, electric water heater, public water and sewer, no HOA, 'Duplex (residential income)'Úremarksaë␀␀Well-maintained duplex offering two 2-bedroom, 1-bath units in an established area with strong rental appeal. The lower unit has been recently updated with fresh paint, new carpet, and additional improvements ... The upper unit is occupied by a long-term tenant of over 10 years ... Property features newer roof, HVAC systems, and water heater ... Both leases are currently in place through April 2027, making this an ideal opportunity for investors or future owner-occupants planning ahead.Úmarket_panelzºRedfin 27104 (8/2026): median sale 353,000, sale-to-list 98.7 percent, 34 days; for this listing Redfin prints 'most homes are selling 7 percent below list' and sale-to-list 92.7 percentÚagentzmMarcel Perez-Ayala, Alterna Real Estate, (704) 898-4444 (a Charlotte-area number; the seller is in Mint Hill)Úrental_historyÚlower_unit_2025_26am␀␀HotPads '306 Auburndale St #306': 2 bd / 1 ba, 850 a month, 'No longer available', 40 application fee, central air, washer-dryer hookups, pet-friendly; ad copy: '2 bedroom and 1 bathroom duplex comes with fridge, stove and back porch area. Washer and dryer connections are included. Water is included and tenant is responsible for electricity. COMING SOON! Vista Realty' (336) 768-1433; Google snippet dates the listing 12/3/2025; Trulia: 'listed as a rental in December 2025 with an asking price of 850 per month. That rental listing was removed on March 10, 2026', lease term 1 year; Trulia rent estimate 1,098 (9/2026)ÚfacebookzÐVista Realty Inc post: '306 Auburndale Winston Salem, NC 27103 2 Bedroom 1 bathroom duplex- Lower level unit. Unit includes stove, refrigerator, new carpet/vinyl, basement...' (metadata only; no date or rent)a}␀␀the 'recently updated lower unit' turned over 12/2025-3/2026 and was marketed at 850 with water included; a 12-month lease from about April 2026 matches 'both leases through April 2027'; the upper unit has no rental record on any portal (a tenant of more than ten years); the documented roll is therefore about 850 + (at or under 850) = about 1,700, against the board's 2,390 proxyÚmanagerz­Vista Realty (336) 768-1433 marketed the unit; the sale is listed by a Charlotte-area agent; ask the agent who manages the leases and whether Vista Realty holds the depositsÚ
