  "excerpt": "Renovated bathroomTwo bedroomsUpdated kitchen INVESTORS \u2014 this duplex is the opportunity you've been waiting for! Located in a charming neighborhood close to shopping, dining, and everyday conveniences, this well-maintained duplex offers two 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom units, both currently rented. Each unit features a spacious front living room, two bedrooms, an updated kitchen, and a renovated bathroom. Recent updates include flooring, paint, appliances, cabinets, and more. With no carpet and neutral finishes throughout, both units offer a clean, attractive living space that tenants can enjoy. Both units are currently occupied, providing an opportunity for an investor to add a turnkey income-producing property to their portfolio. Whether you're an experienced investor or looking to expand your real estate holdings, this duplex offers an excellent combination of location, updates, and existing rental income. Don't miss the opportunity to add this well-maintained duplex to your investment portfolio!"
 },
