  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "dom": null,
  "built": 1910,
  "zestimate": 335800,
  "remarks": "Exceptional investment opportunity in the heart of Winchester! This unique offering includes three income-producing rental units for one price: one duplex and one single-family home located at 211, 213, and 215 E. Clifford Street. The duplex features two separate 2-bedroom, 1-bath units, while the single-family home also offers 2 bedrooms and 1 full bath. The properties are deeded separately as two parcels (tax #193-01-T-9 & 193-01-T-8) , providing added flexibility for future investment strategies. All occupied units are currently rented on month-to-month leases, offering the new owner maximum flexibility to adjust rents, renovate, or continue operating as investment properties. As of the listing date, one unit is vacant, presenting an immediate opportunity to place a new tenant at market rent or occupy the property. Prospective buyers are welcome to drive by and walk the exterior of the properties. Interior showings are by appointment only. Whether you're looking to expand your rental portfolio or invest in a property with immediate income potential and future upside, this is a rare opportunity within Winchester City limits.",
  "type_line": "Duplex",
  "mls": "VAWI2011056",
  "last_event": "Price cut: $11K (8/14) $339,000 # 211-213 E Clifford St #215, Winchester, VA 22601 9beds ",
  "photo": "https://photos.zillowstatic.com/fp/6519496374631da4b5f24e93839299c9-cc_ft_960.jpg",
  "unit_rent_text": "",
  "excerpt": "Exceptional investment opportunity in the heart of Winchester! This unique offering includes three income-producing rental units for one price: one duplex and one single-family home located at 211, 213, and 215 E. Clifford Street. The duplex features two separate 2-bedroom, 1-bath units, while the single-family home also offers 2 bedrooms and 1 full bath. The properties are deeded separately as two parcels (tax #193-01-T-9 & 193-01-T-8) , providing added flexibility for future investment strategies. All occupied units are currently rented on month-to-month leases, offering the new owner maximum flexibility to adjust rents, renovate, or continue operating as investment properties. As of the listing date, one unit is vacant, presenting an immediate opportunity to place a new tenant at market rent or occupy the property. Prospective buyers are welcome to drive by and walk the exterior of the properties. Interior showings are by appointment only. Whether you're looking to expand your rental portfolio or invest in a property with immediate income potential and future upside, this is a rare opportunity within Winchester City limits."
 },
