  "excerpt": "Welcome to this cozy up-and-down duplex! Offers spacious unit features 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom each, offering comfortable living with a smart layout. Step into the modern kitchens, which features LPV flooring and plenty of storage. The bathrooms feature contemporary fixtures and finishes. This property offers separate entrances for privacy, convenient location near schools, shopping, and public transportation. Some images in this listing have been virtually staged."
