  "remarks": "Spacious duplexRear exitsNew roof Investor Special Interior and Siding Full Rehab New Roof\u2014 Duplex With Plenty of Potential! This spacious duplex offers 3\u20134 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms in each unit, with separate upstairs and downstairs living spaces and rear exits. The property also features a new roof and is ready for an investor to complete and customize. Excellent opportunity for a long-term rental, house hack, or fix-and-flip resale project. Property is being sold strictly AS-IS. Buyer is responsible for completing all inspections and due diligence before submitting an offer. Cash or hard-money offers only.",
