  "zoning_line": "",
  "unit_rent_text": "",
  "remarks": "Newer flooring Looking for a home with the major updates already done? Take a look at 2723 Rivercliff Rd, Fayetteville, NC 28301. This 2-bedroom, 2-bath home is half of a duplex and has several updates already completed, including an approximately 2-year-old roof, updated sewer line, new electrical panel, newer flooring, and fresh interior and exterior paint. The kitchen features appliances that are approximately a year old, and the refrigerator, washer, and dryer are included. The primary bedroom has its own private bathroom, while the second bedroom is served by a separate full bathroom. Conveniently located near schools, shopping, dining, walking trails along the Cape Fear River, Fayetteville State University, and Fayetteville Technical Community College. Railroad tracks are nearby, and occasional train noise may be heard. With its updates, included appliances, and convenient location",
  "tract_tier": "P",
