  "remarks": "Solid, low-maintenance brick duplex offering a prime addition to any investment portfolio. Each side features an efficient, easy-to-manage 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom layout with functional living spaces and durable finishes. Both units received an interior facelift and cosmetic updates in recent years, keeping maintenance low and interiors comfortable for occupants. The property is fully occupied by reliable, long-term tenants, offering immediate day-one cash flow with zero downtime. Solid brick exterior construction ensures low exterior upkeep and lasting value. Perfect for hands-off investors looking for stable returns, or a 1031 exchange looking for clean, dependable multi-family assets.",
