  "remarks": "CONTRACT FELL THROUGH. .. NO FAULT OF SELLER. This property has been in the same family for 53 years. These one level duplex/homes are perfect for people who want to live side by side but not under the same roof, investors, family members, friends or live in one duplex/home and lease the other one out. The duplex/home on the left was thought to be built shortly after the time the seller's husband bought the original home which was 1973. Nice flat yard that is mostly fenced in an established area close to dining, shopping and busline. Pull down attic in home at 126 of for additional storage.",
