  "sqft": "",
  "remarks": "This turnkey investment property is a fantastic opportunity for house hacking or rental income! The well-maintained duplex features upgraded electrical wiring, freshly painted interiors and exteriors, and new architectural shingles on the main house, complemented by matching white shingles over the charming covered front porch. Both units offer laundry hookups, new vinyl tile, and luxury vinyl plank flooring, while blown-in insulation in the upstairs walls and attic ensures energy efficiency. Tenants will appreciate the level back lawn, basement storage, and off-street parking for four vehicles, as well as the property's prime location near a grocery store, pharmacy, restaurants, Valley View Mall, and a convenient bus line. Great for Owner occupant income to cover the payment. Can be converted back to a single family dwelling by reinstalling a doorway.",
