  "excerpt": "Newly remodeled two bedroom, one bath duplex. New LVP throughout. Coming into the front door, two bedrooms are on the right hand side and a bathroom is straight ahead. The living room is towards the left with the door to the kitchen on the back side wall. Kitchen is newly remodeled with new counter tops, painted cabinets, stainless steel stove and a black refrigerator. The W/ D connection is in the large eat in kitchen. Unit A is currently on the rental market for $975. Unit B is rented for $950. The upgrades in unit B are the same as unit A. Only Unit A is available for viewing. Unit B is virtually the same. We will make arrangements with the tenant once we have an accepted offer."
