  "sqft": "",
  "remarks": "Unlock flexibility and income potential with this well-maintained Oxford duplex offering approximately 2,920 square feet of combined living space and multiple ways to make the property work for you. Two spacious units create an appealing setup for an investment property or owner-occupant seeking the benefit of rental income, with one unit currently occupied and the second vacant and ready for a new tenant or personal use. Combined rental potential is approximately $2,600 per month, offering the opportunity to generate income from both units or help offset housing expenses while living in one side. Meaningful capital improvements have already been completed, including a roof, water heater, and upstairs HVAC system replaced within the past three years, adding everyday convenience and reducing the need to tackle several major updates right away. Generous living space across both units provides room for comfortable daily living and flexible use, while the duplex configuration expands the possibilities for long-term rental ownership or a live-in investment strategy. Conveniently located near downtown Oxford with access to shopping, dining, and major commuting routes, this property combines space, flexibility, recent improvements, and income-producing potential in one practical package.",
