  "excerpt": "This 2BR/1BA duplex (4BR/2BA total across both units) is part of a larger investment opportunity with a total of 5 duplexes being sold as one package. Properties available are: 1702 Birchwood Dr. , built in 1982 (PIN 3721-73-0503, Tax Value $121,609); 1703 Birchwood Dr. , built in 1982 (PIN 3721-73-2600, Tax Value $114,535); 1706 Birchwood Dr. , built in 1982 (PIN 3721-73-0493, Tax Value $121,648); 1707 Birchwood Dr. , built in 1983 (PIN 3721-73-2590, Tax Value $131,003); 1708 Birchwood Dr. , built in 1983 (PIN 3721-73-1348, Tax Value $145,800); each unit is 2BR/1BA and are all currently occupied. If you're looking to update your investment portfolio, these properties will certainly be worth a look! Call today for more details. Photos for each property are attached. Current rent amounts are in Agent Remarks."
 },
